<title>BRAZIL: Brazil denies Central Bank head Loyola to resign.</title>
<headline>Brazil denies Central Bank head Loyola to resign.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government Tuesday denied market rumors Central Bank President Gustavo Loyola had handed in his resignation.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Presidential Palace said the rumor was untrue.</p>
<p>Stock traders said the rumor had not had much effect.</p>
<p>((-- Brasilia newsroom, 55-61-2230358))</p>
</text>
